|--------|--------|-----------|------|-----|------|
| arxiv (t+i+f) | 0.916 | **0.919** | 0.910 | 0.910 | attention |
| steam (t+i) | 0.616 | 0.620 | 0.613 | 0.613 | attention |
| tmdb (t+i) | 0.488 | 0.492 | 0.490 | 0.490 | attention |
| wikiart (t+i) | 0.872 | **0.898** | 0.871 | 0.871 | attention |

